{"unit_id":"Bosaiting__dsh-process-tree#card-zh","repo":"Bosaiting/dsh-process-tree","commit":"61b982d92172c8ba9c76e53849b4f2547b114540","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Process Tree 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面版 Web 界面的过程树插件。它在聊天工具调用记录旁绘制 SVG 树线，并提供代码块、经典曲线、安静线条和植物风格。代码块视图可将已记录的工具名称、参数、注释及嵌套调用排成任务函数，并选择 Python、JavaScript、C、C++、Java 或 Go 作为展示格式；失败列表、迷你地图和折叠控制帮助浏览记录。插件保留宿主原有结果与链接交互，无法安全匹配时显示原生摘要。可在设置页调整样式、颜色及细节，偏好保存在本地浏览器存储中；不需要额外账号或 API 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2647-2675"]}
{"unit_id":"Bosaiting__dsh-process-tree#card-en","repo":"Bosaiting/dsh-process-tree","commit":"61b982d92172c8ba9c76e53849b4f2547b114540","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Process Tree adds an interactive SVG tree to DSH Web and Desktop, with code, classic, quiet and botanical styles. Code view formats recorded calls as Python, JavaScript, C, C++, Java or Go task functions. A failure list, minimap and folding aid navigation. Settings save locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2647-2675"]}
